,Duality,30,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: OP13-Karaoke,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Translation,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: OP13-Kanji,Duality,60,&H00E24B33,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,10,10,110,1Style: OP13-Credits,FOT-Greco Std B,40,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,95,100,1,0,1,2.2,0,1,80,10,100,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:03.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Destroy Navy HQ!Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.02,0:00:13.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay out of my line of fire.Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.86,0:00:20.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Here he comes again!Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.64,0:00:27.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Ice Ball!Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:45.86,Main,,0,0,0,,– He froze Whitebeard! – You did it!Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:00:58.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, my...Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:01:02.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like I can't freeze a quake man...Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:04.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Ice...Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:10.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Admiral Kuzan!Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.72,0:01:14.19,Main,,0,0,0,,– He stabbed him with Haki! – Is Aokiji dead?!Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.56,0:01:23.56,Main,,0,0,0,,No! Don't be ridiculous.Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.73,0:01:31.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Ice Block: Partisan!Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.43,0:01:53.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Pops, get going!Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:55.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.53,0:02:03.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Diamond Jozu...Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.63,0:02:13.85,Main,,0,0,0,,We're almost there!Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.81,0:02:19.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I can see the execution platform!Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.55,0:02:22.32,Main,,0,0,0,,We've just gotta break through in the confusion!Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.32,0:02:24.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you!Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:27.19,Main,,0,0,0,,You're all gonna die here!Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:39.71,Main,,0,0,0,,A-Ace...Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:29.07,Title,,0,0,0,,Oris PlazaDialogue: 0,0:05:30.61,0:05:32.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:38.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I, Momonga, stake my pride as a  Navy vice admiral on stopping you right here!Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.45,0:05:41.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Vice admiral... So you're the same as Grandpa, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.85,0:05:42.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.09,0:05:45.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Moon Walk!Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:56.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear...!Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.24,0:05:58.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Secon...Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:01.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're out of energy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:03.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.45,0:06:34.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Garp. Consider your position!Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.33,0:07:01.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You gotta have more than just courage...Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:03.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy,Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.88,0:07:10.51,Main,,0,0,0,,without enough strength,  you can't save anyone, no matter how hard you try.Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.90,0:07:17.32,Main,,0,0,0,,A-Ace...Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.55,0:07:24.89,Main,,0,0,0,, – Kill Whitebeard!  – We won't let you!Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.99,0:07:29.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Now will you please just disappear?Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.97,0:07:39.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace's little brother!Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:42.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace...Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.00,0:07:54.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh. Whitebeard's command has been dulled...Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.66,0:07:57.56,Main,,0,0,0,,To think that a man like you...Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:08:02.09,Main,,0,0,0,,would let such reckless trash...Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.09,0:08:05.80,Main,,0,0,0,,lead your attack.Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.20,0:08:11.97,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't let you touch Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:14.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, how admirable...Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.93,0:08:17.74,Main,,0,0,0,,There he is! It's Straw Hat-boy!Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.74,0:08:19.95,Main,,0,0,0,,There he is, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.85,0:08:21.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's that?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.89,0:08:23.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's that voice coming from?Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.61,0:08:28.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you see me?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:31.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Ivankov, dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.12,0:08:33.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Up there!Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.15,0:08:35.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with the size of his face?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.52,0:08:37.36,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Ivankov, from the Revolutionary Army!Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:38.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:41.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you still alive, Straw Hat-boy?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.07,0:08:43.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm...Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.20,0:08:45.74,Main,,0,0,0,,not falling!Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.13,0:08:49.14,Main,,0,0,0,,He fell!Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.94,0:08:52.86,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.86,0:08:54.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.39,0:08:58.28,Main,,0,0,0,,What a noisy guy.Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.00,0:09:02.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Iva-chan... Jinbe...Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.65,0:09:06.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me go, old man!Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.19,0:09:09.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm... Let me go!Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.40,0:09:12.84,Main,,0,0,0,,He's done more than enough. Treat his wounds.Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.84,0:09:13.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Yessir!Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.77,0:09:15.95,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't need that! There's no time!Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.95,0:09:19.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I've gotta go save him! Don't get in my way!Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.10,0:09:22.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace is... Ace is...Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.01,0:09:23.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace is...!Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.44,0:09:28.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Ace is my only brother in the world!Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.45,0:09:29.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll...Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.59,0:09:31.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely...Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.48,0:09:32.94,Main,,0,0,0,,definitely...Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:36.12,Main,,0,0,0,,save him!Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.36,0:09:45.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun! Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:46.56,Main,,0,0,0,,This is awful...Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.56,0:09:50.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, Doctor!  Do whatever you can to keep him alive!Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:53.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun! Luffy-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.02,0:09:54.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Luffy-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:59.71,Main,,0,0,0,,A bundle of spirit, who only knows how to talk big...Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.71,0:10:02.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Young and clumsy...Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:09.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I like fools like that...Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.27,0:10:19.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Those with no regard for their lives, advance!Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.33,0:10:24.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Here he comes! It's Whitebeard!Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:39.68,Main,,0,0,0,,If we just let you run wild as you please...Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:41.65,Main,,0,0,0,,the island won't be able to take it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.36,0:10:47.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Then try to protect it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.23,0:10:49.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Take care of Luffy-kun for me.Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:51.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, what about you?Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:55.70,Main,,0,0,0,,I've chosen this as the place where I die!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.25,0:11:24.73,Main,,0,0,0,,We've gotta clear a path for Pops!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.73,0:11:28.45,Main,,0,0,0,,These are swordsmen as well... However...Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.45,0:11:31.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Such pitiful weaklings!Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.87,0:11:33.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Move!Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.96,0:11:40.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Clear a path!Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.97,0:11:45.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I must go to where Luffy is!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:47.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Do not interfere!Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.12,0:11:48.55,Main,,0,0,0,,This is awful!Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.55,0:11:52.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Boa Hancock has started attacking indiscriminately again!Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:01.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Slave Arrow!Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.90,0:12:13.55,Main,,0,0,0,,The corpses keep piling up!Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:32.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get in Pops' way!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.78,0:12:38.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm very tasty, actually...Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.24,0:12:44.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not done... Not yet...Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.77,0:12:48.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Push them back!Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:50.15,Main,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.15,0:12:53.22,Main,,0,0,0,,The pirates' allies from the shore!Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:54.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait!Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.25,0:12:57.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we've been waiting for you!Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.09,0:13:00.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! We let far too many of them get into the plaza!Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:03.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Uncle will yell at me!Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.22,0:13:07.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Under the circumstances,  some casualties will be inevitable,Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.83,0:13:11.46,Main,,0,0,0,,but try to avoid hitting our own allies.Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:13.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Pacifista!Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.68,0:13:25.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Ace!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.99,0:13:33.39,Main,,0,0,0,,He's flying!Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.39,0:13:35.69,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?! Shoot him down!Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.53,0:13:40.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Our guns won't work!Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:43.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care! Keep shooting!Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.62,0:13:58.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Commander Marco!Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:13.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Nobody told you to jump in on your own!Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.93,0:14:17.30,Main,,0,0,0,,The Hero, Monkey D. Garp!Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.30,0:14:20.95,Main,,0,0,0,,The legendary marine has finally made his move!Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.68,0:14:23.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Garp!Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.31,0:14:28.39,Main,,0,0,0,,The vice admiral's in!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:30.35,Main,,0,0,0,,He's the best guardian we have!Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.99,0:14:32.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Gramps...Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.74,0:14:35.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Garp...Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.59,0:14:41.19,Main,,0,0,0,,If you want to get past me, you'll have to kill me!Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.06,0:14:43.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Dumb kids...Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.20,0:03:21.21,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing SewilDialogue: 0,0:03:21.21,0:03:27.02,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Quality Control Galaxy 9000 PepperjackDialogue: 0,0:03:27.02,0:03:31.99,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Timing LanceDialogue: 0,0:03:31.99,0:03:37.73,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Translation YibisDialogue: 0,0:03:37.73,0:03:43.17,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Visual Effects Datenshi KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:03:43.17,0:03:48.24,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Graphics DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:53.88,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Karaoke KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:57.36,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Soundtracking HaleeDialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:59.49,OP13-Credits,,0,0,0,,Raws cloaknsmokeDialogue: 0,0:03:16.27,0:03:17.67,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.27,0:03:17.67,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.55,0:03:16.37,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 0,0:03:16.37,0:03:17.77,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 1,0:03:15.63,0:03:16.49,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 1,0:03:15.63,0:03:16.49,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 1,0:03:15.63,0:03:16.49,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.49,0:03:17.89,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,meDialogue: 1,0:03:15.71,0:03:16.68,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.08,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:03:15.79,0:03:17.05,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 1,0:03:15.79,0:03:17.05,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:18.45,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gaDialogue: 1,0:03:15.87,0:03:17.31,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 1,0:03:15.87,0:03:17.31,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:03:15.87,0:03:17.31,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.31,0:03:18.71,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 1,0:03:15.95,0:03:17.66,OP13-Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0: